{"id":"0bb5ccbcd92bda96","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-reflection-implies-consistency.md","title":"真理反思与矛盾不真蕴含一致性","display":"cor-reflection-implies-consistency — 真理反思与矛盾不真蕴含一致性","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-reflection-implies-consistency","aliases":["91-cor-reflection-implies-consistency"],"display":"cor-reflection-implies-consistency — 真理反思与矛盾不真蕴含一致性","depends_on":["[[91-df-reflection-principle]]","[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","[[91-df-global-reflection]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-reflection-implies-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-reflection-implies-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-reflection-implies-consistency — 真理反思与矛盾不真蕴含一致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" href=\"?note=fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" title=\"91-df-reflection-principle\">91-df-reflection-principle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"16b107dfee99998b\" href=\"?note=16b107dfee99998b\" title=\"91-df-global-reflection\">91-df-global-reflection</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\)</span> (PA 的标准可证性谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\\equiv\n\\forall x(\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\land\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\to T(x))\">\\(\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\\equiv\n\\forall x(\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\land\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\to T(x))\\)</span>\n(真理形式的全局反思, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"16b107dfee99998b\" href=\"?note=16b107dfee99998b\" title=\"91-df-global-reflection\">91-df-global-reflection</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> (固定矛盾句)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}implies\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\land\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\neg\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}implies\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\land\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\neg\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\\)</span>，\n句子编码条件与全局反思立即给出\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\\)</span>，与第三前提矛盾。第三前提也\n可由适当的 T-out 原则\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\\to\\bot\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\\to\\bot\\)</span> 得到。</p>\n<p>单独写下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\to T(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\to T(x)\\)</span> 还不够：若理论不保证\n矛盾不真，反思只把 PA 的潜在矛盾送入真理谓词，并不产生内部矛盾。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-reflection-principle","status":"resolved","id":"fa1e29f5683a4d6f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-reflection-principle]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-global-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"16b107dfee99998b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-global-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-global-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"16b107dfee99998b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\\equiv\n\\forall x(\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\land\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\to T(x))$\n(真理形式的全局反思, see [[91-df-global-reflection]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\\equiv\n\\forall x(\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\land\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\to T(x))","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}implies\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\land\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\neg\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\\to\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\to T(x)","display":false}],"bytes":1572,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-202","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-reflection-implies-consistency]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-202","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-reflection-implies-consistency]]"}],"outgoing":["fa1e29f5683a4d6f","4e50c115b0d32044","16b107dfee99998b"]}